, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/abzi9tuvqeolwkbjdj0z.jpg"}, {"id": 154340, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/xuvk0y4gkvdbxqwbbtxt.jpg"}, {"id": 154345, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/xyjkdnrcn775nfrw4skh.jpg"}, {"id": 154343, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/qghskujsr7zclqfremis.jpg"}, {"id": 154344, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ygtklfj7elxszbreyxlg.jpg"}], "slug": "carnival-king", "summary": "Step right up for a frantically fun, arcade-style, big top shooter.\n\nCarnival King is a fun-for-all ages video game that brings the spirit and energy of competitive carnival games to the screen. Players compete for top scores and prizes while visiting three different amusement parks: Arcadia, Dreamland and Lagoon Park. Each park has four sets of games and a Bonus Round that test the speed and accuracy of a player's shooting skills. Whether a novice or a sharpshooter, the games are continually challenging, and the difficulty level can be adjusted to match the player's growing confidence.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/carnival-king"}